<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">I'll be whole, but I don't know when</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora had a rough path her entire life, and it didnâ€™t get better until she was 17, when she finally got out of her toxic household and went to live with her best friend. Everything in Adora's life was going well, from going to college to having new friends. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora and Catra thought that everything was going to be fine as long as they had each other, so what happens when Adora's past comes back to torment her once again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TW: Read at your own precaution, this work includes mentions of Homophobia and Eating Disorders&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Sof_WR20</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
